        "ratings": [
            {
                "comment": "Prof. Young is absolutely fantastic. He truly cares about his students and even gets to know everyone's names and hobbies. While there is a bit of reading for this class, it was all super engaging and easy to read. It is almost impossible not to get an A in this class. I would highly recommended to anyone.",
                "difficulty_rating": 1,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Prof. Young seemed to really care for his students.  He gave every opportunity to make up assignments or missed classes, basically making it impossible to not get an A as long as your put in effort.  The course material was engaging and he seemed to genuinely value our input on the course content.  ",
                "difficulty_rating": 1,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Class was an easy A because he gives you every opportunity possible to get an A. He gives you opportunities to make up absences and make up assignments when you miss the deadline. A lot of reading and writing, but it's fairly easy. Still, I felt like I learned a lot and read some cool stuff. ",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 4
            },
            {
                "comment": "Great personable guy. Really enjoyed the class, learned a lot, and appreciated how Morris made it as immersive as possible. Readings are pretty short and exams are straight-forward with no strings attached. 270 was a fantastic choice for ethnic studies.",
                "difficulty_rating": 1,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Such an easy class to understand. Switch to online went amazing. Gives clear instructions and keeps understandable schedule for assignments. Also has wonderful knowledgeable TA's. Would absolutely recommend.",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "TAKE THIS CLASS IF YOU CAN! Easy A but also interesting subject matter so makes the papers easier. And professor Young is so sweet and extremely lenient if you miss a class or draft deadline.",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "He is easily one of the most knowledgeable, understanding, and easygoing professors you would ever come across. Amazing human.",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 5
            }
